{"title":"Career Roadmap · Legal Manager","role":"Legal Manager","summary":"A Legal Manager manages an organization's legal requirements and helps the business identify, control and resolve legal risks.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Business Law (BBA LLB / B.Com LLB)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Legal Manager manages an organization's legal requirements and helps the business identify, control and resolve legal risks."},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a traditional litigation-focused lawyer, a Legal Manager works closely with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business teams"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"HR"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Senior management"},{"text":"External law firms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract review"},{"text":"Contract negotiation"},{"text":"Legal risk assessment"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Corporate documentation"},{"text":"Dispute management"},{"text":"Vendor agreements"},{"text":"Employment matters"},{"text":"Intellectual property coordination"},{"text":"Legal notices"},{"text":"External counsel management"},{"text":"Legal operations"},{"text":"For an LLB graduate, this is a strong in-house legal career."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B. / Integrated LL.B.","Corporate Legal Internship","Legal Executive / Legal Associate","Legal Counsel / Assistant Manager - Legal","Legal Manager","Senior Legal Manager","Legal Head / Head of Legal","General Counsel / Chief Legal Officer"]},{"type":"p","text":"An LLB graduate should also satisfy the applicable professional requirements if the position involves practicing law or appearing before courts."}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During L