"text":"Legal Operations"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Excel + Power BI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CLM Tools"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI Legal Technology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Business Acumen"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"In-House Legal Internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B.","Business/Corporate Law","Contract Drafting & Review","Negotiation","Corporate Compliance","Due Diligence","Legal Risk Management","Privacy/IP/Technology Law","Legal Operations","In-House Legal Internship","Legal Associate/Counsel","Legal Manager","Senior Legal Manager","Head of Legal / General Counsel"]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the strongest profile is legal expertise + commercial understanding + contract skills + technology-enabled legal operations. A future Legal Manager should be able to understand what the business wants to achieve, identify the legal and commercial risks, propose practical solutions, negotiate workable terms, manage compliance and coordinate external counsel—rather than simply identifying what the law says."}]}]}